OL,3,GNEWSASuspected 250kg unexploded WW2
OL,4,Amissile found in docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 300m (984ft) cordon is in place after
OL,7,Fa suspected unexploded bomb was found
OL,8,Fin a dock.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said
OL,11,Femergency services were called out
OL,12,Fafter the object, which is believed to
OL,13,Fbe a 250kg American missile from World
OL,14,FWar Two, was found in water at Falmouth
OL,15,FDocks at 09:15 BST.
OL,17,FAt about 17:25, the force extended the
OL,18,Fcordon from 150m (492ft) which covers
OL,19,Fland and sea, while investigation work
OL,20,Fis carried out.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
