OL,3,GNEWSASuspected 250kg unexploded WW2
OL,4,Amissile found in docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs a precaution, three residential
OL,7,Fproperties have been evacuated, and the
OL,8,Fpublic is urged not to approach the
OL,9,Farea or enter any restricted zones.
